  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the given plots for a reaction obeying Arrhenius equation <math><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo></math> (<math> <mi>K</mi> </math>and <math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></math> are rate constant and activetion energy, respectively )<br /><br />(I)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b67bb79e-7840-4e51-91c8-73f575d0d4e4-image.png\" style=\"width: 215px; height: 215px;\" /></p><p>(II)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0c91ad90-7d94-434c-900b-ac4eb1f7183c-image.png\" style=\"width: 203px; height: 212px;\" /></p>",
